  "description": "A high-level, delightful, fail-closed file and stream encryptor for .NET. The stable core is symmetric and passphrase-based: authenticated AES-256-GCM containers with chunked streaming and progress, PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 or Argon2id key derivation, and an envelope-key provider seam (IContentKeyProvider) for KMS/HSM scenarios. AES-256 keeps your data confidential against a quantum (harvest-now-decrypt-later) adversary. Production post-quantum public-key encryption — X25519 + ML-KEM-768 hybrid combiner with multi-recipient support — ships as the companion package PostQuantum.FileEncryption.Hybrid. AOT-compatible; deterministic builds; cross-implementation tested against an independent Rust/WASM reference.",
