  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0 — adds the Hybrid companion package (X25519 + ML-KEM-768), an envelope-key provider seam (IContentKeyProvider + LocalKekContentKeyProvider), a `pqfe` CLI sample, continuous coverage-guided fuzzing (cargo-fuzz + SharpFuzz), and discoverable options helpers (PqEncryptionOptions.Argon2id, WithArgon2id, WithPbkdf2, WithChunkSize). CI now covers Linux/Windows/macOS plus a native-AOT publish smoke test; the release pipeline runs OSSF Scorecard and validates every .nupkg before push. 0.x: the on-disk format may still change before 1.0.",
